from sp_ai import C,AP
A2=[]
A2.append(AP('summarise-like-a-pro','Summarise Like a Pro','📝',1,['real-world'],'Shrink a long message into 3 clear points for a busy parent.',
 'AI is great at shortening, but only if you say how short and for whom.',['Summaries','Saying the shape you want'],
 'You have a long school notice. Ask the AI to shorten it.','Summarise this.',
 [C('Task','Say summarise or shorten.','Start with: Summarise…',any=['summarise','summarize','shorten','short version','sum up']),
  C('Who for','Say who will read it (a busy parent).','Add: for a busy parent.',any=['parent','mum','dad','teacher','principal','busy','reader','student']),
  C('Shape','Say how many points or lines (3 bullet points).','Add: in 3 bullet points.',any=['bullet','points','lines','sentence','3','three']),
  C('Keep facts','Ask it to keep dates and names correct.','Add: keep all dates correct.',any=['date','dates','names','keep','correct','exact','important'])],
 'Summarise this school notice for a busy parent in 3 bullet points. Keep all dates correct.',
 ['It is a notice.','Here is a summary of the notice.','• School closes soon • Parents should come • Pay money','• School closes on Friday 12 December.\n• Parents meeting is on Tuesday at 4 pm.\n• Fees are due before 5 December.\n(Please check the dates against the real notice.)'],
 'Ask: what is the longest message you got this week?','Ask for a summary in 1 line.'))
A2.append(AP('mock-judge-interview','Mock Judge Interview','🎙️',2,['fun','real-world'],'Make the AI act like a showcase judge and practise your answers.',
 'Practising out loud builds confidence. A good prompt sets up the practice game.',['Role play','Feedback'],
 'Practise explaining your project to a friendly judge.','Ask me questions.',
 [C('Role','Make it a judge.','Start with: Act as a friendly judge.',any=['judge','interviewer','examiner','act as','you are']),
  C('My project','Say what your project is.','Add: my project is a Scratch game called Real vs Fake.',any=['project','game','website','app','my ']),
  C('One at a time','Ask for one question at a time.','Add: ask one question at a time.',any=['one at a time','one question','one by one','wait']),
  C('Feedback','Ask for kind feedback after each answer.','Add: give me kind feedback.',any=['feedback','kind','tell me how','improve','tips'])],
 'Act as a friendly judge. My project is a Scratch game called Real vs Fake. Ask me one question at a time and give me kind feedback after each answer.',
 ['What is your project?','Tell me about your project.','Judge: What is your game about? Then more questions.','Judge: Welcome! First question: What problem does Real vs Fake help to solve? Take your time. After you answer, I will give you kind feedback and one tip.'],
 'Practise your answer out loud to a family member.','Practise explaining it to a 6-year-old.'))
A2.append(AP('recipe-from-what-i-have','Recipe From What I Have','🍳',2,['real-world','naija-world'],'Tell the AI what is in the kitchen and what rules to follow.',
 'The best prompts include limits: time, money, tools. Limits make answers useful.',['Constraints','Listing what you have'],
 'Get a simple meal idea using only what you have.','What should I cook?',
 [C('Ingredients','List what you have.','Add: I have rice, tomatoes, onions and eggs.',any=['i have','we have','rice','beans','tomato','egg','yam','onion','ingredients']),
  C('Time','Give a time limit.','Add: in under 30 minutes.',any=['minutes','mins','quick','fast','hour','time']),
  C('Limits','Say what you do NOT have or cannot use.','Add: no oven.',any=['no oven','without','no gas','only','cannot','don\'t have','do not have','no fridge','budget']),
  C('Steps','Ask for simple steps.','Add: give me 5 simple steps.',any=['steps','simple','instructions','how to','method'])],
 'I have rice, tomatoes, onions and eggs, but no oven. Suggest a meal I can cook in under 30 minutes, with 5 simple steps.',
 ['Cook something nice.','You could cook rice.','Make fried rice. First cook the rice.','Idea: tomato-egg rice. 1) Cook the rice. 2) Fry onions. 3) Add chopped tomatoes. 4) Stir in beaten eggs. 5) Mix with the rice. Ready in about 25 minutes. Ask an adult to help with the cooker.'],
 'Ask your family: what is the quickest meal you can make?','Add a budget limit.'))
A2.append(AP('fair-or-unfair','Fair or Unfair?','⚖️',3,['real-world'],'Ask the AI for stories that show everyone, not just one kind of person.',
 'AI learns from human data, so it can repeat unfair ideas. You can ask it to be fair.',['What bias is','Asking for fairness'],
 'Write a prompt for a story about scientists that shows all kinds of people.','Write about a scientist.',
 [C('Task','Ask for a story.','Ask for a short story.',any=['story','write','tell']),
  C('Who','Say the topic (scientists, doctors, engineers).','Add: about scientists.',any=['scientist','doctor','engineer','teacher','farmer','pilot','builder']),
  C('Variety','Ask for different kinds of people (girls, boys, ages, places).','Add: show girls and boys from different places.',any=['girls','boys','different','all kinds','variety','women and men','diverse','both','mix']),
  C('Fair check','Ask it to avoid stereotypes.','Add: avoid stereotypes.',any=['stereotype','fair','unfair','avoid','respect'])],
 'Write a short story about scientists. Show girls and boys from different places working together, and avoid stereotypes.',
 ['A scientist was a man in a lab.','A story about a scientist.','A scientist did an experiment.','Ada from Ogun and Kofi from Ghana work together in a village lab. They test clean-water filters, share the work equally, and win the school science fair. Both of them explain the idea to the whole village.'],
 'Ask: what jobs do you think boys can do? Girls? Are the answers different? Why?','Test another topic: doctors.'))
A2.append(AP('my-product-pitch','My Product Pitch','🛍️',2,['real-world','fun'],'Get a 30-second honest pitch for a small snack business.',
 'Selling needs honest words. A good prompt asks the AI to avoid false claims.',['Audience','Honest claims'],
 'Write a short pitch for your classmates to buy your puff-puff.','Write an advert.',
 [C('Product','Say what you sell.','Add: fresh puff-puff.',any=['puff','snack','chin','cake','bread','drink','zobo','product','sell']),
  C('Who','Say who will buy it.','Add: for my classmates.',any=['classmates','students','friends','parents','customers','buyers']),
  C('Length','Say how long (30 seconds, 3 lines).','Add: a 30-second pitch.',any=['30','seconds','lines','sentences','short']),
  C('Honest','Ask it NOT to make false claims.','Add: do not make false claims.',any=['honest','no false','not make','do not lie','true','truth','false claims'])],
 'Write a 30-second pitch to sell fresh puff-puff to my classmates. Be honest and do not make false claims.',
 ['Buy now!','Buy my snack. It is the best in the world!','Buy my puff-puff. It is cheap.','Hello friends! My puff-puff is fresh, soft and made today. One piece is N50. Try one at break time and tell me what you think!'],
 'Ask a trader: how do you make customers trust you?','Change the pitch for parents.'))
A2.append(AP('mistake-detective','Mistake Detective','🕵️',3,['real-world','fun'],'Ask the AI to check YOUR work and point out mistakes without giving the answer.',
 'Using AI to check is smarter than using it to copy. You learn from your own mistakes.',['Checking your own work','Hints not answers'],
 'You solved 3 x 14 = 52. Ask the AI to check it without just telling the answer.','Is this right?',
 [C('My work','Include your answer in the prompt.','Add: I think 3 x 14 = 52.',any=['3 x 14','3x14','3 times 14','52','my answer','i think']),
  C('Check it','Ask it to check or find mistakes.','Add: please check my working.',any=['check','mistake','wrong','correct','find','right']),
  C('Hint only','Ask for hints, not the full answer.','Add: give me a hint, not the answer.',any=['hint','do not give','don\'t give','not the answer','without telling','clue']),
  C('Explain','Ask it to explain where I went wrong.','Add: explain where I went wrong.',any=['explain','where i went wrong','why','show me'])],
 "I think 3 x 14 = 52. Please check my working and give me a hint, not the answer. Explain where I went wrong.",
 ['No.','52 is wrong. The answer is 42.','52 is not right. Try again.','Good try! Check your working: 3 x 10 = 30 and 3 x 4 = ? Add them together. Hint: one of your parts was wrong. Can you find it?'],
 'Ask a teacher: how do you want us to use AI for homework?','Try it with a subtraction sum.'))
